DATA AND RESULTS. The contents of `results/` and `data/evidence/` are released
under CC-BY-4.0. They are derived from public sources that carry their own terms
and must be cited independently:

  ENCODE Consortium eCLIP peaks        https://www.encodeproject.org
  GENCODE release 45                   Frankish et al., gencodegenes.org
  NCBI ClinVar                         Landrum et al.
  UCSC phyloP 100-way
  Horlacher et al. 2023, Brief Bioinform 24(5):bbad307
    negative sets via Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.10600977, CC-BY-4.0

No genomic sequence is redistributed here: the committed evidence carries window
identifiers, labels, fold assignments and model scores only.
